{
 "kind": "package-set-records",
 "package_set": "trillion",
 "record_set": "workshop-space-tool-records",
 "what_this_is": "What any space can turn on, whatever its label, as Workshop tools a space installs (src/space-capabilities.mjs). Each row's `invoke.capability` names the capability and its `space_capability` is the capability itself: `icon` for its switch; `keys`, the configuration keys (each a path) that together are it, so it is on when all of them are there; `requires`, capabilities that must be on with it (turning one on turns these on too, and turning one off turns off what requires it); `starts_with`, what it adds the first time it is turned on. A space's installed tools (src/spaces.mjs space_tool_grants) are kept in step with what is on at the one configuration write (src/community.mjs keepConfiguration): a new space installs what its label starts with (src/network-settings.json membership_labels.configuration), removing the tool turns it off and installing it turns it on. Turning one off moves its keys into the configuration's `set_aside`, and turning it on again brings them back as they were. A label and `description` are its switch's words. Running a row (an account action) turns it on or off in the space named. A new capability is a row here.",
 "records": [
